<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — KowakianMonkeyLizard creature port
  (Pass 14). Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's
  `KowakianMonkeyLizard` ThingDef/PawnKindDef pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml,
  workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the RSW_ tier prefix.
  Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim.

  Body: the donor's custom `KowakianMonkeyLizard` BodyDef needs only its
  tail part repointed to the ALREADY-PORTED Wave B `RSW_SW_DexterousTail`
  BodyPartDef — every other part is a plain bipedal-primate composition of
  vanilla Core parts (Clavicle/Ribcage/Sternum/Pelvis/Neck/Head/Skull/
  Brain/Eye/Ear/Nose/Beak, Shoulder/Arm/Hand/Finger, Leg/Femur/Tibia/Foot/
  Toe). Its own tools (fists->LeftHand/RightHand, bite->Beak,
  head->HeadAttackTool) are all vanilla groups the donor leaves bare, no
  custom groups involved. Ported as RSW_KowakianMonkeyLizard
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml).

  Resources: `leatherDef` (`Leather_Mammavian`) ALREADY EXISTS as
  `RSW_Leather_Mammavian` (Wave B) — new meat needed
  (`RSW_Anthropoid_Meat`, texPath swresource/Meat_Anthropoid, newly
  extracted this pass, `ParentName="RSW_SWanimals_RawMeatBase"` matching
  every other Wave B/C raw-meat port). No egg comp (not an egg-layer). No
  ability — its only `specialTrainables` entry is vanilla `AttackTarget`,
  left bare.

  No ArtOverride collision — a full `find src/RimStarWars -maxdepth 1
  -iname "*ArtOverride*"` for a KowakianMonkeyLizard-named folder found
  none. All art shipped from SWBestiary.

  Art: 19 PNGs extracted this pass via extract_bundle.py against the live
  Steam workshop bundle (workshop folder 3497316713) — base
  KowakianMonkeyLizard_south/east/north (3), KowakianMonkeyLizard_Dessicated
  (1, one shared texture across all 3 life stages), plus the donor's own
  5-variant `alternateGraphics` set (A/B/C/D/E, 80% chance per PawnKindDef,
  each with its own south/east/north facings, 15 PNGs) — all confirmed
  non-zero and PIL-openable.

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: per cast_assignment.csv's own
  ground truth (AridShrubland 0.01, renamed in place from the bare donor
  row).
-->
